.Dd August 1, 2026
.Dt INTEGRIS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm integris
.Nd local engineering CLI for Integris sync increments
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Cm sync
.Fl source Ar dir
.Fl destination Ar dir
.Op Fl json
.Op Fl plan-only
.Op Fl no-journal
.Op Fl journal Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
provides operator-facing engineering commands.
.Bl -tag -width serve
.It Cm sync
Unidirectional local directory synchronization with staged publication,
SHA-256 verification, and journaled crash resume under
.Pa destination/.integris/ .
See
.Pa docs/localsync.md .
.It Cm serve / Cm push
Authenticated TCP push using provisional session auth and AEAD (shared root
key), with chunked file transfer and mid-file resume under
.Pa destination/.integris/recv-partial/ .
Optional
.Fl chunk-size
on
.Cm push
overrides the default 256 KiB chunk.
Optional
.Fl peer
selects a named peer when the receiver uses an M2i PSK allow-list.
See
.Pa docs/remotesync.md
and
.Pa docs/daemon-m2a.md .
.El
.Pp
It is not the privilege-separated daemon
.Xr integrisd 8 .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It 0
Success.
.It 1
Sync or runtime failure.
.It 2
Invalid usage or arguments.
.It 3
Unsafe path.
.It 4
Unsupported filesystem object.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr integris 7 ,
.Xr integrisd 8
